---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Sandstone Stucco Co"
  description="How Sandstone Stucco Co handles the details you send through the quote form and basic site analytics."
  canonical="https://sandstonestucco.ca/privacy/"
>
<style is:global>
  .rich p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3A332C; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3A332C; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rich h2 { font-size: 24px; color: #7A5A32; margin: 32px 0 12px; }
  .rich a { color: #4B5D6B; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
<section style="padding:64px 24px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="rich" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;">
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 8px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:#5A5148;font-size:14px;">Last updated 30 September 2026</p>
    <p>Sandstone Stucco Co (sandstonestucco.ca) is an advertising service that puts homeowners in Calgary and area in touch with independent stucco contractors. This page explains what we collect and what happens to it.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>What you send us.</strong> If you use the quote form, we receive the details you type: your name, phone number, city or area and your description of the damage. If you call, we see the number you call from.</li>
      <li><strong>Site usage.</strong> We may use Google Analytics to count visits and see which pages are used. It records things like pages viewed, approximate location and device type, not your name.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>We use your enquiry to put you in touch with an independent stucco contractor who can look at the job and quote it. That means we pass your enquiry details to that contractor. The contractor quotes and contracts with you directly and handles your information under its own practices.</p>
    <p>We do not sell your information and we do not use it for unrelated marketing.</p>
    <h2>Service providers</h2>
    <p>The form is processed by Formspree and the site is hosted by Vercel; analytics, where enabled, is Google Analytics. These providers process data on our behalf and may store it outside Canada.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask us what we hold about you, or ask us to correct or delete it, by emailing <a href="mailto:info@sandstonestucco.ca">info@sandstonestucco.ca</a>. You can block analytics cookies in your browser settings.</p>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
